      "id": "kern-journey",
      "type": "text",
      "width": "full",
      "heading": "IN DEVELOPMENT",
      "body": "KERN is the project I am currently trying to solve, which means most of this folder is design work in motion.\n\nThe central question is simple to state and difficult to make into a game: if the player encounters an anomaly they do not understand, how do they investigate it, infer what it does, and act on that knowledge without the interaction collapsing into a checklist?\n\nThe prototype footage, pitch material and institutional graphics are shown together because KERN’s fiction and mechanics are being designed at the same time.",
      "source": "",
      "mediaRef": "",
      "href": "",
      "label": "",
      "projectId": "",
      "alt": "",
      "fit": "cover"
    },
